[00:14.76]1. O Jehovah, God of goodness,
[00:19.50]You have blessed us all our days!
[00:23.94]You are holy, ever loyal,
[00:28.24]And so good in all your ways.
[00:32.76]You show favor, granting mercy,
[00:37.54]Far beyond what we deserve.
[00:42.76]You’re so worthy of our worship,
[00:46.40]And it’s you we gladly serve.
[00:58.72]2. Your own goodness is reflected
[01:03.24]In the people whom you choose;
[01:07.34]And the proof is in their conduct
[01:12.04]And the preaching of good news.
[01:17.02]Your good teaching, your good shepherds,
[01:21.76]Bear good fruit in many lands.
[01:26.30]May you grant us holy spirit,
[01:30.90]And may goodness guide our hands.
[01:44.76]3. May you bless our deeds of goodness
[01:49.44]To our brothers, great or small.
[01:54.00]May we show them special favor
[01:58.18]As we work at good t’ward all.
[02:02.80]In each fam’ly, congregation,
[02:07.48]In each town and neighborhood,
[02:12.16]With your blessing and your spirit,
[02:16.48]May we be a force for good.
